      "mds:procedureDetails": "N-(1,3-dimethyl-1H-pyrazol-5-yl)-4-iodo-5-(trifluoromethyl)pyridin-2-amine (50 mg, 0.13 mmol), 2-amino-N,6-dimethoxybenzamide (43.6 mg, 0.22 mmol), diacetoxypalladium (1.469 mg, 6.54 µmol), (9,9-dimethyl-9H-xanthene-4,5-diyl)bis(diphenylphosphine) (7.57 mg, 0.01 mmol) and potassium carbonate (36.2 mg, 0.26 mmol) were suspended in 1,4-dioxane (423 µl) and sealed into a microwave tube. The reaction was degased, purged with nitrogen and heated to 90 °C overnight => _not complete but seemed to be clean, no des-iodo by-product formed, both SM left_  Same reaction was performed in toluene (423 µl) => _reaction complete, LCMS profile similar to the conception document reference_  **_NOT ISOLATED_**  ",
      "mds:safetyNotes": "None"
